# Allow only source and public documentation; never personal media or runtime metadata.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!__music/
__music/*
!__music/index.html
!docs/
!docs/REFERENCE.md
!docs/screenshots/
!docs/screenshots/*.png
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!scripts/
!scripts/*.mjs
!scripts/*.py
!tests/
!tests/*.test.mjs
